classDiagram
    %% Final design: matches pawpal_system.py

    class Task {
        +str title
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str time
        +str frequency
        +bool completed
        +str pet_name
        +date due_date
        +mark_complete() None
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +get_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +int available_minutes
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        -_due_today() list~Task~
        +generate_schedule() list~Task~
        +sort_by_time() list~Task~
        +filter_by_status(completed: bool) list~Task~
        +filter_by_pet(pet_name: str) list~Task~
        +detect_conflicts() list~str~
        +mark_task_complete(task: Task) Task
        +explain_plan() str
    }

    Owner "1" --> "*" Pet : has
    Pet "1" --> "*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : gets all tasks from
    Scheduler ..> Task : creates next recurring task